# 行尾契约：文本统一 LF，二进制与 Windows 脚本显式豁免
# 背景：2026-10-06 曾因 Windows/WSL 双端无契约，出现整文件 CRLF↔LF 翻转噪音。
# 策略见 docs/platform-strategy.md。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 侧必须保持 CRLF 的脚本
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf

# 二进制（禁止任何换行符处理）
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls  binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.otf  binary
*.pyc  binary
*.pfx  binary
*.p12  binary

# 语言级确定性（供 GitHub 统计与 diff 识别）
*.py   text
*.mjs  text
*.ts   text
*.tsx  text
*.json text
*.md   text
*.yml  text
*.yaml text
*.toml text
*.css  text
*.html text
*.svg  text

# lock 文件不参与 diff 与 merge 冲突（由工具重建）
pnpm-lock.yaml  -diff merge=binary
package-lock.json -diff merge=binary
